  ·
    refine ⟨_, _, key (X 0 0 - X 1 0 / G 1 0 * G 0 0) (X 1 0 / G 1 0) (by ring) ?_ ?_ ?_⟩
    · field_simp; linear_combination h00
    · field_simp
    · field_simp; linear_combination h10
  ·
    refine ⟨_, _, key (X 0 0 - X 0 1 / G 0 1 * G 0 0) (X 0 1 / G 0 1) (by ring) ?_ ?_ ?_⟩
    · field_simp
    · field_simp; linear_combination -h00
    · field_simp; linear_combination -h01
