    refine ⟨_, _, key (X 0 0 - (X 0 0 - X 1 1) / (G 0 0 - G 1 1) * G 0 0) ((X 0 0 - X 1 1) / (G 0 0 - G 1 1)) (by ring) ?_ ?_ ?_⟩
